ail, web, apps, commerce, and CRM."}, {"id": "3dddc2cc-be9b-4b3e-8a89-3fe0b6d7fd66", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Measurement and attribution", "children": [{"id": "6fd260f2-c009-4d87-b8e5-9f788b0aa073", "type": "concept", "title": "Conversion"}, {"id": "8ac0510c-ccbc-4a69-a92b-54d5056a002a", "type": "concept", "title": "Incrementality"}, {"id": "02e48f7c-cec1-45ef-a32e-6d2f4255fb41", "type": "concept", "title": "Marketing mix modeling"}, {"id": "d895e7e3-77fe-4811-ae71-3423eeeb809c", "type": "concept", "title": "Customer journey analytics"}], "description": "Gist: Students connect behavior to metrics while recognizing attribution limits."}, {"id": "3719e5b4-0c9b-4e45-8787-fdf988bdb884", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Privacy and consent", "children": [{"id": "d5635ca7-7f5b-4082-8215-f243f27db021", "type": "concept", "title": "First-party data"}, {"id": "c2ac5a46-13fc-4dca-b61e-0b1d85d39587", "type": "concept", "title": "Cookie changes"}, {"id": "0ee62bee-3402-4399-8d8c-bef133952157", "type": "concept", "title": "Consent management"}, {"id": "50f86a97-c9e0-4619-a105-a7085e35bf43", "type": "concept", "title": "Algorithmic fairness"}], "description": "Gist: Responsible consumer insight requires data ethics, consent, security, and respect for boundaries."}]}, {"id": "80d98dce-767e-4562-bbb3-85bc5a70aa2f", "type": "topic", "title": "Applied Consumer Insight Project", "description": "Synthesize behavioral theory, research evidence, segmentation, journey analysis, and ethical recommendations in a final project.", "children": [{"id": "b65546a8-721c-4d40-aa95-f4ee71aaf5fa", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Problem framing", "children": [{"id": "0405d642-5da2-400d-a264-04006224fc6f", "type": "concept", "title": "Business objective"}, {"id": "832e75ff-f63c-4ba9-8284-91146ad279ac", "type": "concept", "title": "Consumer question"}, {"id": "d1717581-2399-4afb-a48d-0372243a2939", "type": "concept", "title": "Hypothesis"}, {"id": "1054dfbb-eed2-4e17-9ed5-30adcab14257", "type": "conce